AHA-DSH-wallpaper — unofficial fan theme preview

This is an unofficial fan theme for DeepSeek Harness. It is not endorsed by
DeepSeek, HoYoverse, or the creators of the referenced game artwork.

The illustrations, decorative wordmark, cropped frame pieces, video, and poster
are derived from the user's local reference collection. The three welcome
stickers include AI-derived transparent-background edits; their input and prompt
records are included in assets/welcome-prompts.json. They are not asserted to be
pixel-identical extractions or newly cleared independent artwork. The stage
perimeter and transparent
gold frame also include AI-derived edits using the built-in image_gen tool;
assets/stage-edit-prompts.json records the prompts. The central figure is
overlaid from the retained original illustration at runtime. Original rights
remain with their respective owners. No open-source license for these media is
asserted by this preview. See assets/provenance.json for source and processing
records. Redistribution permission remains unconfirmed; this preview must
not be represented as a cleared public asset release.

