the authoring workspace. The source artwork is not claimed as newly authored;
publication and redistribution permission remain unverified. The derivative
uses alpha matting with local ink-boundary repair and edge color unmatting,
without generative character redraw. See assets/wind-aha-v2.source.json.

The clear red theater side scenery added in preview.10 was generated with the
