The prompt, output hash and processing record are included in
assets/stage-clear-backdrop.source.json. This reference-derived background is
subject to the same unconfirmed media redistribution review described above.

The heart and shy welcome animations added in preview.12 were generated and
exported by the user in Jimeng from the corresponding existing chibi references.
The original downloads and their AIGC metadata are retained unchanged in the
